  "body": "Reported by `jcgruenhage`:\r\n\r\n* attempts to `/join #matrix-dev:matrix.org` fail with 'Room '!XqBunHwQIXUiqCaoxq:matrix.org' does not exist'\r\n* Someone tried sending him an invite - attempts to accept or reject give the same result\r\n\r\nIt looks like there was a previous attempt to join the room from the same server back in January, which ended up with incomplete state in the db (in particular it is missing the `m.room.create` event, hence the error)",
